flowchart TD
  A[Reviewed source + contracts] --> B[CI tests / security / eval]
  B --> C[Build image + SBOM + provenance]
  C --> D[Sign immutable release bundle]
  D --> E[Compatibility + migration gate]
  E --> F[Staging smoke tests]
  F --> G[Canary traffic]
  G --> H{Error / quality / cost gates pass?}
  H -->|Yes| I[Promote candidate]
  H -->|No| J[Rollback compatible bundle]
  I --> K[SLO dashboards + alerts]
  J --> K
  K --> L[Backup restore + incident drills]
